{"ID":"20240727165400-e6mtczx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240727165400-e6mtczx","title":"连钱草（活血丹、透骨消、金钱艾、十八缺）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902175238"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240727165426-l9enzyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727165426-l9enzyp","updated":"20240727165840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草-20240727165426-o2gfxqn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 3-20240727165648-0siuyub.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727165441-rhml7sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727165441-rhml7sh","updated":"20240727165609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 1-20240727165441-nrh41da.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 817px;","style":"width: 807px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 2-20240727165604-z0ty75i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 807px;\" parent-style=\"width: 817px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727165648-csovyjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727165648-csovyjh","updated":"20240727165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 385px;","style":"width: 375px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 5-20240727165930-d0jd655.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 375px;\" parent-style=\"width: 385px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 4-20240727165915-k7i35jx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727170234-2fkqdfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170234-2fkqdfw","updated":"20240727170328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 8-20240727170234-ikxcivc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"width: 604px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 630px;","style":"width: 620px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 9-20240727170328-yh9asc6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 620px;\" parent-style=\"width: 630px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727170139-gxypwxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170139-gxypwxs","updated":"20240727170828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 327px;","style":"width: 317px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 6-20240727170139-5zq9dyf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 317px;\" parent-style=\"width: 327px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 858px;","style":"width: 848px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连钱草 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连钱草 11-20240727170828-grcs7ol.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 848px;\" parent-style=\"width: 858px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727170913-sltnp9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170913-sltnp9y","updated":"20240727170913"}},{"ID":"20240727170910-511s6xm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170910-511s6xm","updated":"20240727170910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"易混淆品种（连钱草、铜钱草、金钱草、破铜钱、积雪草）"}]},{"ID":"20240727170910-k6y92cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170910-k6y92cv","updated":"20240727170910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240727153805-5gddcod.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727171019-nto6ji4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171019-nto6ji4","updated":"20240727171113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240727163626-r6qt16y","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"铜钱草（香菇草、水金钱）"}]},{"ID":"20240727171019-63s7ih4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171019-63s7ih4","updated":"20240727171125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240205153748-igsdarp","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"金钱草"}]},{"ID":"20240727171019-3a0j5g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171019-3a0j5g3","updated":"20240727171132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240727164422-zgnnfe2","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"破铜钱（天胡荽）"}]},{"ID":"20240727171019-798rnm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171019-798rnm8","updated":"20240727171139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240504170621-38fj7z1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"198积雪草（雷公根）"}]},{"ID":"20240727170033-9326mzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170033-9326mzy","updated":"20240727170044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：连钱草的花是成对开的。"}]},{"ID":"20240727165650-neett8f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240727165650-neett8f"}},{"ID":"20240902175233-qnpuie6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-qnpuie6","updated":"20240902175238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：活血丹"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-1dti0nk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-1dti0nk","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"活血丹"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-rcmwalw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-rcmwalw","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HuóXuèDān"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-edphtd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-edphtd2","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】遍地香、地钱儿、钹儿草、连钱草、铜钱草、白耳莫、乳香藤、九里香、半池莲、午年冷、遍地金钱、金钱早草、金钱艾、也蹄草、透骨消、透骨风、过墙风、甾骨风、蛮子草、胡薄荷、穿穿墙草、团经药、风草、肺风草、金钱薄荷、十八缺草、江苏金钱草、一串钱、四方雷公根、马蹄筋骨草、破铜钱、对叶金钱草、疳取草、钻地风、接骨消"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-pj667ux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-pj667ux","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-pz326x3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-pz326x3","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为唇形科植物活血丹的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-17qr41m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-17qr41m","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Glechomalongituba(Nakai)Kupr[G.hederaceaL.var.longitubaNakai;G.hederaceaauct.nonL.]"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-qiubjij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-qiubjij","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：4-5月采收全草，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-mgd94wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-mgd94wd","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】活血丹，多年生草本，高10-30cm，幼嫩部分被疏长柔毛。匍匐茎着茎地生根，茎上升，四棱形。叶对生；叶柄长为叶片的1.5倍，被长柔毛；叶片心形或近肾形，长1.8-2.6cm，宽2-3cm，先端急尖或钝，边缘具圆齿，两面被柔毛或硬毛。轮代站花序通常23花；小苞片线形，长4mm，被缘毛；花萼筒状，长9-11mm，外面被长柔毛，内面略被柔毛，萼齿5，上唇3齿较长，下唇2齿略短，顶端芒状，具缘毛；花冠蓝色或紫色，下唇具深色斑点，花冠筒有长和短两型，长筒者长1.7-2.23cm，短筒者长1-1.4cm，外面多少端凹入；雄蕊4，内藏，后对较长，花药2室；子房4裂，花柱略伸出，柱头2裂；花盘杯状，前方呈指状膨大。小坚果长圆状卵形，长约1.5mm，深褐色。花期4-5月，果期5-6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-0i219p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-0i219p2","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-q70xxtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-q70xxtc","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海参拔50-2000m的林缘、疏林下、草地上或溪边等阴湿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-qlqlzqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-qlqlzqr","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：全国各地除甘肃、青海、新疆及西藏外，均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-q7rvakf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-q7rvakf","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-a3am02z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-a3am02z","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别，茎叶方柱形，细而扭曲，长10-20cm，直径1-2mm，表面黄绿色或紫红色，具纵棱及短柔毛，节上有不定根；质脆，易折断，断面常中空。叶对生，灰绿色或绿褐色，多皱缩，展平后呈肾形或近心形，长1-3cm，宽1.5-3cm，边缘具圆齿叶柄纤细，长4-7cm。轮伞花序腋生，花冠淡蓝色或紫色，二唇形，长达2cm。搓之气芳香，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-uon7vgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-uon7vgl","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以叶多、色绿、气香浓者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-2ant0t1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-2ant0t1","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别，茎横切面：呈方形。表皮胞1列，有非腺毛及腺毛，皮层薄壁细胞约8列，角隅处于厚角组织；内皮层处有厚角组织；内皮层凯氏点明显。维管束外韧型，环列；韧皮部外侧有木化纤维，木质部较宽，髓部薄壁细胞较大。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-9jhr4kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-9jhr4kx","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：灰绿色，1.非腺毛多细胞，常有1-几个细胞缢缩，另有单细胞锥状非腺毛。2.原鳞头部8细胞。3.小腺毛头部单细胞：柄单细胞。4.叶下表皮细胞壁波状弯曲。5.上表皮细胞垂周壁波状弯曲，有较细宇航局的角质纹理。6.螺纹、网纹导管直径20-20μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-bcf3l5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-bcf3l5l","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】茎叶含挥发油，主成分为左施松樟酮(pinocamphone)，左旋薄荷酮(menthone)，胡薄荷酮(pulelgone),α-蒎烯(α-pinene)，β-蒎烯(β-pinene)，棕檬烯(limonene)，1-8-桉叶素(1,8-cineole)，对-聚伞花素(p-cymene)，异薄荷酮(isomenthone)，异松樟酮(isopinocamphone)，芳樟醇(linalool)，薄荷醇(mentholk)及α-松油醇(α-terpineol)等。成分随产地、采用及其他因素而有所差异还含欧亚活血丹呋喃(glechomafuran)，欧亚活血丹内酯(glechomanolide)。此外尚含熊果酸(ursolicacid)，β-谷甾醇(β-sitosterol)，棕榈酸(palmiticacid)，琥珀酸(succinicacid)，咖啡酸(caffeicacid)，阿魏酸(ferulicacid)，胆碱(choline)，维生素C及水苏糖(stachyose)等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-irj5tlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-irj5tlw","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-c33xqr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-c33xqr8","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.利胆作用，能肿进肝细胞的胆汁分泌，肝胆管内胆汁增加，内压增高，胆道括纸醉金迷肌松弛，而使胆汁排出。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-odc1npo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-odc1npo","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.利尿作用，煎剂大鼠灌胃有显着着利尿作用，连续应用则利尿作用逐渐降低。麻醇家兔试验也有明显利尿作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-xgc6hjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-xgc6hjv","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.溶解结石作用，能使小便变为酸性，而使存在于碱性条件下的结石溶解。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-b99vx38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-b99vx38","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.抑菌试验对金黄色葡萄球极度敏感，宋内痢疾杆菌中离敏感，大肠杆菌、绿脓杆菌、伤寒杆菌均不敏感。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-yjhzm2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-yjhzm2u","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味苦；辛；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-mqyd75v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-mqyd75v","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；胆；膀胱经"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-9wpm8ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-9wpm8ye","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】利湿通淋；清热解毒；散瘀消肿。主热淋石淋；湿热黄疸；疮痈肿痛；跌仆损伤"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-bzyn3na","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-bzyn3na","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，15-30g；或浸酒，或捣汁。外用：适量，捣敷或绞汁涂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175233-t3mkdki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175233-t3mkdki","updated":"20240902175239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175234-v1ohoco","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902175234-v1ohoco","updated":"20240902175239"}},{"ID":"20240902175235-olcb0ip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175235-olcb0ip","updated":"20240902175239"}}]}